ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS / 致谢

This project stands on the shoulders of DeepSeek Harness
(https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness), an Apache-2.0 licensed
multi-agent orchestration framework. The macOS desktop shell (HarnessShell/)
embeds the harness runtime; the `@whalepod/honeycomb` plugin (packages/honeycomb/)
adapts its Cordis plugin primitives (service / events / lifecycle / config /
persistence) into the workstation's team-management model.

Special thanks to:
  * DeepSeek — for the upstream `deepseek-harness` project and the
    `@deepseek-ai/cordis` / `@deepseek-ai/schemastery` plugin primitives that
    `@whalepod/honeycomb` builds on.
  * Shigma — author of the original Cordis framework that the harness fork
    derives from.
  * dataelement — author of `dsh-desktop` (MIT), the reference Electron
    implementation we studied while designing HarnessShell's "out-of-the-box"
    experience. See `refs/dsh-desktop/LICENSE` for its full text.

The `refs/` and `deepseek-harness/` directories in this repository are
ignored from version control; they are local reference copies only and are
not part of the distributed Software.